:"metadata","text":"升級關愛共乘App💕一App指引旅途【長者篇】︳ Upgraded MTR ‧ Care App for hassle-free journeys (Elderly Ver.)","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3hawsd001ybn5ko2e7yfc6:0003","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3hawsd001ybn5ko2e7yfc6","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"description_text","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"港鐵「關愛共乘」App全面升級喇，為老友記同有需要嘅乘客指引旅途，家燕姐都極力推介！ 簡易版「行程指南」除咗有清晰易用嘅介面同特大圖字，幫老友記規劃最少轉車次數嘅路線外，仲新增實時升降機維修保養資訊，方便老友記出行， 連家燕姐都話好用！快啲介紹畀身邊有需要嘅朋友同屋企人下載喇 ！ #關愛共乘App #一APP指引旅途 #家燕姐 #薛家燕 #出行更自在 #老友記 #長者 #輪椅使用人士 #視障人士 #聽障人士 #共融 #無障礙出行 #無障礙設施 #載向共融未來 MTR has recently upgraded the “MTR ‧ Care” App to assist the elderly and passengers in need to enjoy hassle-free journeys. Even our ambassador Nancy Sit highly recommends it! The “Trip Planner (Simplified Version)” function is equipped with an easy-to-use interface, suggesting the routes with the fewest interchanges with enlarged text and graphics for the elderly. In addition, the newly added Real-time Lift Maintenance Information facilitates the elderly to plan trips in advance! Share this App with your friends and family in need and help them download it now! #MTRCareApp #NancySit #Elderly #WheelchairUser #VisuallyImpaired #HearingImpaired #BarrierFreeFacilities #TravelWithEase #SocialInclusion","text_contains_http":"0.0","youtube_video_id":"","brand_family":"","title":"","source_package":"mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1","source_version":"v0.1"},{"node_id":"evidence:mplifier_graph_probe_mtr_15_clean_v0_1:cmu3hawsd001ybn5ko2e7yfc6:0004","node_kind":"evidence","video_id":"video:cmu3hawsd001ybn5ko2e7yfc6","aspect_type":"","aspect_family":"","aspect_value":"","aspect_value_normalized":"","evidence_kind":"author_metadata","evidence_lane":"metadata","text":"{\"d